  "in_words": "Bar 0 (L1): C on beat 0, F on beat 1 (under 'Baba'nin', where the singer holds A), C on beats 2-3. Bar 2 (L2) and bar 6 (L4): the dominant G for the whole bar. Bar 5: C (beats 0-1 drum fill, beats 2-3 'diye bagirir'). Everything else stays as built: bars 1 and 7 = C G7 C C (loud answer), bars 3-4 = C (animal calls), intro and ending unchanged.",
