   "rule": "In bars 2 and 6 the band plays the dominant WITHOUT its seventh (G B D, no F). The singer sings that seventh herself (F on beats 2 and 3) and sings E right next to it; with F in the band the sung E lies one semitone from a sounding band note. The loud answers (bars 1, 7), the intro and the ending keep the full V7.",
